<title>USA: Group lifts stake in Builders Warehouse.</title>
<headline>Group lifts stake in Builders Warehouse.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Eligrant Inc said Tuesday it raised its stake in Builders Warehouse Association Inc to 264,456 common shares or 6.64 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transaction includes the purchase of 63,315 common shares between August 30 and September 6 at prices ranging from $9.375 to $10.625 per share.</p>
</text>
